# UI design

Avoid the stereotypical AI-generated SaaS look. Prefer flat, restrained, information-dense interfaces.

## Do not use

- Gradients (unless explicitly requested)
- Glow / colored box-shadows
- Glassmorphism / backdrop-blur
- Excessive rounded cards or pill shapes
- Gradients behind text, decorative blobs
- Huge centered hero text
- Card grids and excessive whitespace

## Do use

- Neutral backgrounds; limited palette; **one** accent
- Subtle 1px borders instead of shadows
- Spacing + typography for hierarchy (size/weight, not effects)
- `border-radius: 4–8px` by default
- Real buttons (not pills); left-aligned layouts
- Dividers, whitespace, and alignment before wrapping in containers
- Design around content; group related controls spatially

## Layout mindset

Decide hierarchy for this product first. Do not default to landing-page / dashboard-card patterns.
